## Method
- **Counted:** active + `count_in_total`. Excluded: peptides (INDEXA), planned/paused/retired (incl HMB), 31g syringe + Zontron Minox.
- **Formula:** dose `daily × (dpw/7) × (cost ÷ mass_per_bottle) × 30.44 × (weeks_per_year/52)`; shelf-life `cost ÷ shelf_life_months`; PEDs `weekly × weeks/yr × cost/mg ÷ 12`.
- **Living:** rent/car RM0 (current). Independence scenario (~RM1,800 rent + RM500 car) ≈ doubles the floor.

